\cf0 Document Status\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs22 \cf3 This is a working canonical reference for Cramapple's teaching and curriculum methodology. It defines the default teaching loop, the question-archetype adaptations, the repair sub-modes when a student misses a point, the calibration moves against known AI-grading failure modes, and the research and source authorities that ground each design decision.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \

\f2\fs22 \cf3 This document covers the default teaching loop only \'97 what happens when a student is progressing. A separate companion document will cover the remediation protocol (what happens when a student is stuck or not progressing) once the default loop is validated. The full Stuck Student protocol is explicitly out of scope here.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \

\f2\fs22 \cf3 Statements labeled Decision reflect the current direction. Statements labeled Hypothesis require testing. Items labeled Open remain unresolved.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \

\f2\fs22 \cf3 This document refers back to PEDAGOGY.docx, which holds the underlying cognitive science literature in greater depth. PEDAGOGY is the research foundation; LEARNING_SYSTEM is the operational system. Where the two overlap, this document is the authority on what Cramapple does. PEDAGOGY remains the authority on why those choices are research-grounded.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f3\i\fs18 \cf4 Changelog. v0.5 (June 2026) adds Section 8.7 on the Subject Waitlist mechanism that turns every off-portfolio decline into demand capture: contact collection (phone or email, user-or-parent for COPPA compliance), three uses (subject prioritization, launch marketing, adjacent upsell), and operational infrastructure required. Subsections 8.8 through 8.13 renumbered accordingly. v0.4 added Section 8 on Student-Supplied Questions and Landing Pages. v0.3 reframed integrity signals as coaching. v0.2 added calibration moves and academic AI grading sources.
\f1\i0\fs24 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Purpose\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs22 \cf3 Cramapple needs one consistent teaching methodology that applies across every question, every session, every student. The methodology must be:
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa60\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4\i\b\fs22 \cf3 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\ul \strike \strikec3 Research-grounded \'97 every teaching activity should be traceable to either established cognitive science, College Board guidance, or documented AP teacher practice.
\f1\i0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \ulnone \strike0\striked0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4\i\b\fs22 \cf3 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\ul \strike \strikec3 Deterministic in shape \'97 the student should recognize the structure of any interaction within two sessions, because that structure is itself a metacognitive skill we are transferring.
\f1\i0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \ulnone \strike0\striked0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4\i\b\fs22 \cf3 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\ul \strike \strikec3 Adaptive in content \'97 the methodology applies to MCQ, quantitative, data-analysis, and FRQ archetypes; what changes is the content within each step, not the steps themselves.
\f1\i0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \ulnone \strike0\striked0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4\i\b\fs22 \cf3 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\ul \strike \strikec3 Articulable \'97 Orly, advisors, hired experts, and tutors should be able to read this document and understand exactly what Cramapple teaches, how, and why.
\f1\i0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \ulnone \strike0\striked0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs22 \cf3 Cramapple does not need to explain the methodology to students. The methodology is the architecture beneath the experience. Students see a clean, predictable loop. The research and source structure lives in this document.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa200\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 1. Teaching Premise\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs22 \cf3 Cramapple optimizes for points gained per hour of remaining study time. The teaching system is built on a single premise:
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f3\i\fs22 \cf3 The most reliable way to earn the next AP exam point is to teach the student what that point is testing, have them attempt it, score the attempt against the actual rubric criteria, and repair the specific gap that lost the point.
\f1\i0\fs24 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs22 \cf3 This is the structural commitment underlying every design decision in this document. The methodology is not a curriculum in the traditional sense \'97 it is a repeatable, four-beat interaction pattern called the Score Loop, applied across every question the student encounters.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa200\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2. Source Authorities\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs22 \cf3 Cramapple's teaching methodology draws on four distinct bodies of authoritative work. Each contributes specific design decisions to the system. This section names what each authority provides and where it does not.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2.1 The College Board\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs22 \cf3 The College Board is the official authority on what the AP exam tests, how it is scored, and how skilled AP teachers are trained to teach toward it. Cramapple adopts the College Board's public taxonomies directly rather than inventing parallel ones.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \

\f2\fs22 \cf3 The publicly available authorities include the AP Biology Course and Exam Description (CED), which contains a Course Framework, an Instructional Section, and sample exam questions; released free-response questions with scoring guidelines and annotated sample student responses; and the Course-at-a-Glance, which specifies skill spiraling and pacing.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \

\f2\fs22 \cf3 The most operationally important elements Cramapple adopts from the CED are the Six Science Practices with their exam weightings, and the FRQ archetype definitions with their per-question focus areas. These are the two taxonomies Cramapple's Frame step uses verbatim.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

